cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use leanmap, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "leanmap: parametric landmark-conditioned neighbour embedding"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-08-12"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/phzwart/leanmap"
url: "https://github.com/phzwart/leanmap"
authors:
  - family-names: Zwart
    given-names: Peter
    # orcid: # add when available
abstract: >
  leanmap (LEarn ANother MAPping) is a parametric landmark-conditioned
  neighbour embedding with a cohesive multi-scale graph pyramid. After
  training, inference is a single network forward pass and returns an
  embedding plus a conformal cover score.
keywords:
  - dimensionality reduction
  - neighbour embedding
  - parametric UMAP
  - conformal prediction
  - SAXS
